  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A divine being helps you keep fighting. You have a pool of four d12s that you can spend to heal yourself: as a Bonus Action, you can expend dice from the pool, roll them, and regain Hit Points equal to the total. The pool regains all expended dice when you finish a Long Rest. Its maximum number of dice increases by one at Barbarian levels 6 (5 dice), 12 (6 dice), and 17 (7 dice).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-5CWZAHvBiOumKCH1\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The uses are the d12s of the pool: choose how many to spend in the dialog.</p></section>",
